end LCD "3"
dcc:3 track voltage on after # ms off
dcc:3 service mode on
dcc:3 CV 1 = 5 (service)
dcc:3 ack
dcc:3 CV 29 = 2 (service)
dcc:3 ack
dcc:3 service mode off
dcc:3 speed +0/126
dcc:3 service mode on
dcc:3 verify CV 8 bit 0 = 1
dcc:3 ack
dcc:3 verify CV 8 bit 1 = 1: no
dcc:3 verify CV 8 bit 2 = 1
dcc:3 ack
dcc:3 verify CV 8 bit 3 = 1
dcc:3 ack
dcc:3 verify CV 8 bit 4 = 1: no
dcc:3 verify CV 8 bit 5 = 1: no
dcc:3 verify CV 8 bit 6 = 1: no
dcc:3 verify CV 8 bit 7 = 1: no
dcc:3 verify CV 8 = 13
dcc:3 ack
dcc:3 service mode off
can TX 00000380 [8] 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
